        "A"
      ],
      "basis": "The phosphatase (Scharer) test measures residual alkaline phosphatase in milk to verify pasteurisation; it is not a tea or water test, so \"All of the above\" is indefensible and the answer is Milk (A). The printed key D is wrong."
